### Design Rationale Summary

| Task Type | Rule Type Used | Justification |
|-----------|---------------|---------------|
| find (×3) | position_near_with_facing | Player must navigate to location AND face the target to prove visual identification |
| mine (×3) | inventory_has | Mined blocks drop items into inventory — direct, reliable detection |
| combat (×2) | count_in_box_at_most (max_count=0) | Mob death = mob no longer exists in detection area |
| craft (×3) | inventory_has | Crafted/smelted items appear in inventory — direct, reliable detection |

### Key Improvements Over Previous Version
1. **Removed unverifiable splash potion milestone** — replaced with leather_chestplate (inventory_has)
2. **Tightened find_potted_bamboo** — max_distance reduced to 3, target moved to (6,0,-1) so player must walk 6 blocks and turn to face it
3. **All milestones now use appropriate rule types** — no more position_inside_box proxies
4. **Detection boxes for mobs** are sized to cover the entire playable scene area while relying on doMobSpawning=false to prevent false negatives
5. **Furnace-based cooked_mutton** is faster (10s vs 30s) and more aligned with "craft" semantics than campfire cooking

